  theme: { statement: "Living forever would not be a gift, because change and endings are a natural part of life.", topic_word: "life and death", explanation: "The Tucks are stuck while the world moves on without them. Winnie decides that a normal life is better.", evidence: ["Tuck compares life to a wheel that must keep turning.", "The Tucks must keep moving so no one notices they never age.", "Winnie pours the spring water on a toad instead of drinking it."] },
